==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gd}} {{term|gall||foreigner or stranger|lang=gd}}, meaning:
* {{Ireland}} a person from Wales or England who [[immigrate]]d after the Norman invasion, or
* {{Scotland}} a person from [[Scandinavia]] or the English-speaking lowlands.

